        "Simplify (-b-b³)/(1+b²) = -b(1+b²)/(1+b²) = -b",
        "Obtain arctan(-b) = π/4 or equivalently -b = 1",
        "Solve to get b = -1"
      ],
      "accepted_alternatives": [
        "Set (-b-b³)/(1+b²) = tan(π/4) = 1, factor numerator as -b(1+b²), cancel to give -b=1, hence b=-1."
